	(text "C505/C506: at U502 VCC pins 8/13. C514/C515: at U503 VCC pins 8/13 (AD8352 eval board)."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 25.4 55.88 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left)
		)
		(uuid "620ee179-d1e0-5a09-a123-442a005e7612")
	)
	(text "C522-C532: one at each AVDD pin, C534-C536: one at each DRVDD pin (AD9484 eval board)."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 25.4 58.42 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left)
		)
		(uuid "73c45544-4474-532e-83bb-1f8034cebc0e")
	)
	(text "U502: single-ended in, 15 dB (AD8352 Fig. 26, Table 7)"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 45.72 144.78 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left)
		)
		(uuid "48ccc835-29cb-5843-a84b-049746bdeca8")
	)
	(text "U503: differential, 10 dB (AD8352 Table 5)"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 152.4 144.78 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left)
		)
		(uuid "b768fd2e-68c8-56bf-b865-1269ad6cee11")
	)
	(text "Input network: AD9484 Fig. 30"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 215.9 71.12 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left)
		)
		(uuid "66f5a7f9-f51b-5ffb-b9ea-1dc87a88d5c0")
	)
	(text "To the FPGA: 100 ohm across each pair at the receiver (AD9484 p.16)."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 276.86 172.72 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left)
		)
		(uuid "76e48a3b-7f51-5461-85fb-8e0f78830e21")
	)
	(text "ADC_RADAR - how this sheet works"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 25.4 190.5 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.524 1.524)
			)
			(justify left)
		)
		(uuid "7e816de3-c9ac-53b5-b5c4-ec3d3cf9b425")
	)
	(text "1. The radar IF (120 MHz, AERIS-10) arrives single-ended on IF_RX_B from the routing switch."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 25.4 194.31 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left)
		)
		(uuid "694bf44b-bb06-5ba4-8a63-43ff97b7bc1f")
	)
	(text "2. Two AD8352s give 25 dB, as AERIS-10's two cascaded stages; the first also converts to differential."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 25.4 198.12 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left)
		)
		(uuid "32e21e09-88c6-5f1a-a969-9623b1c3ffd9")
	)
	(text "3. U501 samples at 400 MSPS (radar) or 500 MSPS (SDR plan): the clock comes from CLOCK, Q0."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 25.4 201.93 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left)
		)
		(uuid "ea9c6579-ab0f-5d78-88a3-51af4c9f7775")
	)
	(text "4. CONV_SPI_* are 1.8 V signals: AD9484 abs. max DRVDD + 0.2 V. The FPGA must drive them from a 1.8 V bank."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 25.4 205.74 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left)
		)
		(uuid "64229cc4-d85c-5c4d-853c-b56a4ed0b6b5")
	)
	(text "5. Every value on this sheet is justified in _work/sheets/adc_radar_spec.py and docs/ADC_RADAR_SPEC.md."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 25.4 209.55 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left)
		)
		(uuid "f41efef2-6f31-5ded-a4d8-351b3add511c")
	)
